{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/header_mine.gif?t=1740974468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use mining drills to gather ores and smelt them to gain building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/header_survive.gif?t=1740974468\" /><br><br>Defend your mining site from waves of disgusting hostile alien creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/header_adapt.gif?t=1740974468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your defenses to special alien abilities, daytime and biome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/header_develop.gif?t=1740974468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research new technology to expand your arsenal of passive and active buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513900/extras/seperator.png?t=1740974468\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No asset flip / low effort game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No generative AI used</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solo developer with lots of love and passion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No mixels :)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513900?t=1740974468","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3513900?t=1740974468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor